Subject: [PATCH 69/69] =?UTF-8?q?Nova:=20"Tekshiruv=20kutilmoqda"=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20pending=20postlar=20belgisi=20va=20chop=20etilganda?=
