MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- PendingBadge (uz "Tekshiruv kutilmoqda", ru "Ожидает проверки",
  en "Pending review"): profil to'ri katakchasida (ixcham), lenta
  kartasida, post tafsilotida va Ko'rgazma sahifasida — server
  `pending: true` ni faqat egasiga beradi.
- Chop etilgan post `pending: true` bilan qaytsa snackbar: "Post
  tekshiruvdan so'ng hammaga ko'rinadi" (Ko'rgazma va post yaratish).
- BusinessRepository.createPost endi javobdagi postni qaytaradi
  (bo'lmasa null) — kompaniya posti uchun ham pending bilinadi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
